# 3. Order flow

### 3.1 Place an order > 202 Accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-7",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 4, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 3.2 Get the order > Confirmed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/cust-7/orders/{{orderId}}

### 3.3 Ship the order > Shipped
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/cust-7/orders/{{orderId}}/ship

### 3.4 Order processing metric
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/order-processing?month={{month}}


# 4. Business rules

### 4.1 Order without lines > 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "cust-7", "lines": [] }

### 4.2 Not enough stock > Rejected
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-8",
  "lines": [ { "productId": 3, "quantity": 5 } ]
}

### 4.3 Get the rejected order > Rejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/cust-8/orders/{{rejectedOrderId}}

### 4.4 Ship a rejected order > 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/cust-8/orders/{{rejectedOrderId}}/ship